[en.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CADANCE_NAME]
Princess Cadance

[en.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CADANCE_DESC]
The princess of love in Equestria and the ruler of Crystal Empire. For years, Crystal empire has been thriving under the protection of Princess Cadance. Even at the last moment when Chrysalis and Sombra threatened the Crystal Castle, she never thought of surrendering.

However, it was the crystal heart that was threatened, which would put all crystal ponies in danger. Princess Cadance was forced to accept the ceasefire agreement and was accused of “war crimes”. After the abdication, she was confined to the Crystal Manor. She witnessed the love of the crystal ponies being harvested by the Changelings, and saw the Crystal Empire become a colony of the Changelings and the so-called Equestria Empire. The princess who once protected the Crystal Empire through countless battles can now only stand by the window in the manor, staring at the sky outside, praying that the suffering of the Crystal Empire will be alleviated a little bit...

When the Crystal Empire Independence War broke out, Princess Cadance finally escaped from house arrest and was about to become the princess of the Crystal Empire again. However, the return of King Sombra made this impossible. Before the Crystal Empire was swallowed by darkness, the Liberation Front took emergency action to rescue the Cadance family to Our Town, at the cost of almost all their agents in the Crystal Empire. Princess Cadance hopes that one day she can return to the Crystal Empire, but in the absence of the other three princesses, Equestria needs her more.

Flurry Heart, Mommy hopes you are okay.

[zh.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CADANCE_NAME]
音韵公主

[zh.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CADANCE_DESC]
小马利亚的“爱之公主”，水晶帝国的联合统治者。数年以来，水晶帝国在音韵公主的统治下欣欣向荣。到邪茧与和煦光流威胁水晶城堡那一刻，她也未曾想过投降。

直到水晶之心受到威胁，水晶小马们危在旦夕，音韵公主被迫接受了停战协议，背负了“战争罪”的罪名，从此退位。音韵公主被软禁在水晶庄园，她亲眼见证水晶小马们的爱意被幻形灵收割，见证水晶帝国成为了幻形灵与那所谓的小马利亚帝国的殖民地。这位曾经在一次次战斗中庇佑着水晶帝国的公主，如今只能在庄园的窗边，看着窗外的天空发呆，祈求水晶帝国受的苦难能在少那么一点点...

水晶帝国独立战争爆发，音韵公主终于脱离软禁，即将再次成为水晶帝国的公主。可黑晶王的回归使这成为了不可能。在水晶城被黑暗吞噬前，解放阵线紧急行动，以部署在水晶帝国的特工近乎全军覆没的代价将音韵一家送到了平等镇。音韵公主希望有一天自己能回到水晶帝国，可在其他三位公主都不在的情况下，小马利亚更需要她。

风雪之心，妈妈希望你还好。
